# Multi-tenant SaaS variant (TENANCY_MODE=multi, see infra/README.md).
# Wildcard subdomain per tenant plus on-demand TLS for verified custom domains.
# Requires a DNS provider module built into the Caddy image (e.g. Caddy built
# with `caddy-dns/cloudflare` via xcaddy) for the wildcard cert's DNS-01
# challenge; HTTP-01 cannot issue wildcard certificates.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

